# === the eigenvalues action — load-bearing ===
#
# eigenvalues(m) -> imperfect(spectrum, ref, ref)
#
# Compute the eigenvalues of a real-symmetric matrix m via LAPACK
# dsyev_ at the ONE ordained @io numerical boundary (per canonical
# spec §7). Signature-shape parity with @mirror/phone::dial: callers
# hand the matrix (typed); the crate patches through prismqueer::ffi
# to the LAPACK physical side and returns the spectrum.
#
# Bounded resource: O(n³) polynomial per LAPACK dsyev_; n ≤ 16 per
# FLANG floor discipline (canonical spec §2; Alex 2026-07-20 verbatim:
# "This is literally the FLOOR, Reed. We don't forward promise the
# FLOOR."). Rice-safe by construction; deterministic; content-
# addressable via BLAKE3(input || dsyev_result).
#
# Load-bearing for magic.rs Θ computation per Alex 2026-07-25 [ALEX-
# Q1]: the future-light-cone angle assembles from Fiedler eigenvalues
# of the sheaf-Laplacian restricted to bounded-horizon reachable sets;
# eigenvalues() is the primitive magic.rs composes over.
eigenvalues(m) -> imperfect { \ }

# === the envelope action — Aumann composition-view ===
#
# envelope(m) -> imperfect(singular_values, ref, ref)
#
# Compute the singular-value envelope of a matrix m via LAPACK
# dgesvd_. Aumann-1976 agreement-theorem consequence at numerical
# altitude: the envelope measures the coordination-without-signal
# capacity of the matrix's row/column-space. Composes with @coherence
# via Kuramoto-1975 phase-lock (see shards/epistemologic/cybernetic/
# coherence.mirror which cites "actions widen the future light cone"
# as the substrate-decl phenomenology).
#
# Bounded resource: O(n³) polynomial per LAPACK dgesvd_; n ≤ 16 per
# FLANG floor. Rice-safe; deterministic; content-addressable.
envelope(m) -> imperfect { \ }

# === the phase_lock action — Kuramoto composition-view ===
#
# phase_lock(oscillators) -> imperfect(coherence, ref, ref)
#
# Compute the Kuramoto-1975 phase-lock coherence of a coupled
# oscillator ensemble via matrix eigenvalue computation on the
# coupling matrix. Downstream consumer of eigenvalues() at the
# @coherence species altitude. Composes with the Foerster invariant
# per Alex 2026-07-25 [ALEX-Q1] metric adjudication: phase-lock
# coherence IS a bounded computation of the future-light-cone angle
# at the coupled-oscillator altitude.
#
# Bounded resource: O(n³) polynomial via eigenvalues() primitive;
# n ≤ 16 per FLANG floor. Rice-safe; deterministic.
phase_lock(oscillators) -> imperfect { \ }

# === the content_address action — BLAKE3 composition-view ===
#
# content_address(matrix_result) -> imperfect(oid, ref, ref)
#
# Content-address a matrix-computation result via BLAKE3 32-byte OID.
# Deterministic; linear in input bytes; sub-Turing per canonical spec
# §2 (rust/fractal/ content-hash deterministic guarantee composes
# downward from rust/matrix/ result altitude).
#
# Load-bearing for @subject provenance carriage: matrix results
# crossing the rust/matrix/ → rust/spectral/ boundary carry OID
# provenance so magic.rs Θ computations remain content-addressed +
# reproducible + auditable per Impeccability Discipline D4 (canonical
# spec §14).
content_address(matrix_result) -> imperfect { \ }
